From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: WiVRn Android port <noreply@invalid>
Date: Tue, 15 Sep 2026 21:54:17 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] st/oxr, xrt_defines, bindings: add
 XR_VALVE_frame_controller_interaction

Registers the /interaction_profiles/valve/frame_controller_valve
interaction profile (Steam Frame controller) end-to-end: a new
XRT_DEVICE_VALVE_FRAME_CONTROLLER device name, XRT_INPUT/OUTPUT_* enum
values for its components, the profile's bindings.json entry (component
paths verified against Valve's own published
com.valvesoftware.openxr.utils package docs -- the extension isn't in
the public Khronos registry yet, so there's no formal spec to check
against), an XRT_FEATURE_OPENXR_INTERACTION_VALVE_FRAME_CONTROLLER
CMake option following the existing per-vendor-extension pattern, and
the XR_VALVE_frame_controller_interaction extension name/version
macros in the vendored openxr.h (also absent upstream).

Needed because VRChat's Android build only ever calls
xrSuggestInteractionProfileBindings for this one profile and never
falls back to plain Oculus Touch, so without this our runtime rejects
the call outright and VRChat's controllers are entirely unbound.
---
 CMakeLists.txt                                |   1 +
 src/external/openxr_includes/openxr/openxr.h  |   9 +
 src/xrt/auxiliary/bindings/bindings.json      | 189 ++++++++++++++++++
 .../include/xrt/xrt_config_build.h.cmake_in   |   1 +
 src/xrt/include/xrt/xrt_defines.h             |  46 +++++
 .../oxr_extension_support.py                  |   1 +
 6 files changed, 247 insertions(+)

diff --git a/CMakeLists.txt b/CMakeLists.txt
index 3810b9b72..5791f2ffd 100644
--- a/CMakeLists.txt
+++ b/CMakeLists.txt
@@ -440,6 +440,7 @@ option(XRT_FEATURE_OPENXR_INTERACTION_FB_PROXIMITY "Enable XR_FB_touch_controlle
 option(XRT_FEATURE_OPENXR_INTERACTION_TOUCH_PRO "Enable XR_FB_touch_controller_pro" ON)
 option(XRT_FEATURE_OPENXR_INTERACTION_TOUCH_PLUS "Enable XR_META_touch_controller_plus" ON)
 option(XRT_FEATURE_OPENXR_INTERACTION_LOGITECH_MX_INK "Enable XR_LOGITECH_mx_ink_stylus_interaction" OFF)
+option(XRT_FEATURE_OPENXR_INTERACTION_VALVE_FRAME_CONTROLLER "Enable XR_VALVE_frame_controller_interaction" OFF)
 
 # Defaults for OpenXR layer support
 option(XRT_FEATURE_OPENXR_LAYER_DEPTH "Enable XR_KHR_composition_layer_depth" ON)
